hits: ka is a miss, kb is a miss (fresh), kc is a hit → hits 1, misses 2, fetches 2. My expectation of fetches: 3 was wrong — the third call is a cache hit, no fetch happens. The client is working correctly. My assertion was wrong. Fixing it to fetches: 2.

